    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Savior's Hand is a &quot;simple driving/action game where you find and destroy enemies.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new control method that you have never seen before will delight your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to spend a lot of money to buy expensive gaming equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need a large space to put the gaming equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Everything is ready.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now save the underground world occupied by robots with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the new record.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- H-Shifter is in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gear change using clutch pedal. Acceleration and stopping using brake and accelerator pedal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clutch is very important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>- &quot;Training Zone&quot; is not available in the demo version.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>- In the demo version, pressing start game will immediately enter the &quot;Challenge Zone&quot;.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>- In the demo version, you can kill only up to 10 enemies.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>- In the demo version, there is no lobby where you can check the game record.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>- In the demo version, the gear control section is overwritten with a simple operation method.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Challenge Zone&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The map and enemy locations change every time you start a new game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can save and exit the game at any time, and continue playing later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are gas stations, repair shops, weapon shops, and item shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In the &quot;Challenge Zone&quot;, the time it takes to kill 50 enemies is recorded and ranked. Try to shorten the record.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can use differentiated strategies by using special weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Training Zone&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can practice while watching the friendly explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In the &quot;Training Zone&quot;, items, armor, and fuel are provided infinitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In the &quot;Training Zone&quot;, time is not recorded, so you can practice comfortably. Practice until you are fully acclimated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Tip</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To use the store elevator, unlock all weapons and special abilities and turn off the engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124470/extras/fdd717b0664559ce6d7c6063fb1cb5d5.avif?t=1727228334\" width=634 height=348 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Savior's Hand is a &quot;simple driving/action game where you find and destroy enemies.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new control method that you have never seen before will delight your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to spend a lot of money to buy expensive gaming equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need a large space to put the gaming equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Everything is ready.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now save the underground world occupied by robots with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the new record.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- H-Shifter is in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gear change using clutch pedal. Acceleration and stopping using brake and accelerator pedal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clutch is very important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>- &quot;Training Zone&quot; is not available in the demo version.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>- In the demo version, pressing start game will immediately enter the &quot;Challenge Zone&quot;.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>- In the demo version, you can kill only up to 10 enemies.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>- In the demo version, there is no lobby where you can check the game record.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>- In the demo version, the gear control section is overwritten with a simple operation method.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Challenge Zone&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The map and enemy locations change every time you start a new game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can save and exit the game at any time, and continue playing later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are gas stations, repair shops, weapon shops, and item shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In the &quot;Challenge Zone&quot;, the time it takes to kill 50 enemies is recorded and ranked. Try to shorten the record.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can use differentiated strategies by using special weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Training Zone&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can practice while watching the friendly explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In the &quot;Training Zone&quot;, items, armor, and fuel are provided infinitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In the &quot;Training Zone&quot;, time is not recorded, so you can practice comfortably. Practice until you are fully acclimated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Tip</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To use the store elevator, unlock all weapons and special abilities and turn off the engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124470/extras/fdd717b0664559ce6d7c6063fb1cb5d5.avif?t=1727228334\" width=634 height=348 /></span></p>",
